# ── Your project ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything about a concrete design lives in project/ (requirements, tickets, plans,
# reviews, logs, snapshots, Fusion URNs). It is never part of the framework repo.
# Tip: version it separately with `git -C project init` (private repo).
/project/

# Safety net for the flat layout of older workspaces (pre-project/ layout)
/spec/
/work/
/log/
/BOARD.md
/fusion/documents.md
/fusion/notes.md
/fusion/snapshot/

# CAD data and exports
*.f3d
*.f3z
*.step
*.stp
*.stl
*.3mf
*.iges
*.igs
*.obj

# ── Runtime state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/.fusion-slots/

# ── Per-user Claude Code settings ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# ── OS / editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.qodo/
.vscode/
.idea/
__pycache__/
